@description Test QR Scan API - Upload Image

### Test Scan QR with PNG Image
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/qr/scan
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="qr_code.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./qr_code.png
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

